OL,3,GNEWSA'Abusive' drivers targeting road  
OL,4,Aworkers amid closures                  
OL,6,FCouncillor Richard Wilkins said the    
OL,7,Fwork was "difficult and demanding as it
OL,8,Fis, without the criminal actions of    
OL,9,Fsome road users".                      
